# Shattering Stars (jeuno 132) accepted (a GM) by level 66 chars of the jobs Chamber of Oracles serves: SAM (12), NIN (13), DRG (14),
# one char each (main the first). Each trades its job's testimony (64 with its job id) and answers 1: tradedTestimony
# 1, set down at Chamber of Oracles (-220.084 -0.645 4.442, zone 168); the char zones at the next tick.
# Then each char, in the flow's order, enters its own Maat fight in its own area (1, 2, 3: the fights of one zone
# run side by side): a GM warp by SC_Entrance (the flow parser follows zones by warp), the testimony traded (the 32000
# menu), 32000 updated with option index * 16 + area (registered, entered; the testimony wears), finished; that
# area's Maat "killed" (unkillable: 1 HP; he yields, battlefield:win, at a later onMobFight, so some kills take ticks
# before the 32001 opens; battlefieldWin the fight's id), and the win's 32001 finished: accepted, so a Scroll of
# Instant Warp, Prog = the job id, the job's maatsCap bit (1 << (job - 1): a fresh char's maatsCap is 0), Maat Masher.
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/64 ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrade ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=SAM lvl=66
char nin zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=NIN lvl=66
char drg zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=DRG lvl=66
levelcap 70
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
item SamuraisTestimony
nin: levelcap 70
nin: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
nin: item NinjasTestimony
drg: levelcap 70
drg: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
drg: item DragoonsTestimony
login
trade Maat SamuraisTestimony x1         # SAM's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (12)
finish option=1                         # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Chamber of Oracles
tick 400
login                                   # in Chamber of Oracles
nin: login
nin: trade Maat NinjasTestimony x1      # NIN's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (13)
nin: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Chamber of Oracles
tick 400
nin: login                              # in Chamber of Oracles
drg: login
drg: trade Maat DragoonsTestimony x1    # DRG's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (14)
drg: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Chamber of Oracles
tick 400
drg: login                              # in Chamber of Oracles
warp -218.6,-1.9,23.0 ChamberOfOracles  # by SC_Entrance
trade SC_Entrance SamuraisTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=33                  # Shattering Stars (SAM), index 2, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
kill MAAT                               # Maat (SAM) of area 1: won, battlefieldWin 194, 32001 opens
finish                                  # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 12, maatsCap 2048, Maat Masher
nin: warp -218.6,-1.9,23.0 ChamberOfOracles  # by SC_Entrance
nin: trade SC_Entrance NinjasTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
nin: update 32000 option=50             # Shattering Stars (NIN), index 3, area 2: registered, entered
nin: finish                             # in the arena
nin: kill MAAT+4                        # Maat (NIN) of area 2: 1 HP (unkillable), won once he yields, battlefieldWin 195
tick 1000                               # Maat is unkillable: he yields (battlefield:win) in a later onMobFight; 32001 opens on the last tick
tick 1000
nin: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 13, maatsCap 4096, Maat Masher
drg: warp -218.6,-1.9,23.0 ChamberOfOracles  # by SC_Entrance
drg: trade SC_Entrance DragoonsTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
drg: update 32000 option=67             # Shattering Stars (DRG), index 4, area 3: registered, entered
drg: finish                             # in the arena
drg: kill MAAT+10                       # Maat (DRG) of area 3: won, battlefieldWin 196, 32001 opens
drg: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 14, maatsCap 8192, Maat Masher
